[[Category:Creatures]]

Moonmoths are a kind of [[Bug]] native to the Hearthlands. They are also a [[Curiosity]] that may be studied in a player's [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].

==How to Acquire==

You can acquire a Moonmoth by Right-clicking them while they are flying around, just like one would with [[Silkmoth]]s, [[Ladybug]]s, [[Cave Moth]]s, and other such flying insects. Biomes in which they can be found are [[Grassland]]s, [[Forest Terrain]]s, and [[Moor]]s. Be advised that as per their name, they can only be seen at [[Night]].

